---
// MediaHero.astro
---

<header class="media-hero-section">
  <!-- Hero Main Content -->
  <div class="hero-container">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <!-- Tag / Category Header -->
      <div class="tag-wrapper">
        <span class="category-tag">MEDIA & IMPACT</span>
        <span class="tag-line"></span>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Headline -->
      <h1 class="hero-title">
        Watch Our Latest Public<br />Appearance
      </h1>

      <!-- Description Paragraphs -->
      <div class="hero-description">
        <p>Stay connected with SAKRT's growing presence in India's sustainability movement. Our media page brings together the latest press coverage, public appearances, and recognitions celebrating our commitment to eco-friendly polythene bags. From industry events to state-level sustainability awards, SAKRT continues to be recognized as a trusted name in <a href="/blogs/food-packaging/compostable-cutlery-the-sustainable-shift">compostable packaging</a> manufacturing.</p>
        <p>Based in Mangalore, Karnataka, SAKRT proudly represents Envirly Innovations Pvt Ltd, delivering government-certified compostable bags, polythene bagsfilms, pouches, and tableware to retailers and industrial enterprises across India. Our media features highlight the milestones that matter — from participation in World Environment Day celebrations at ICAR-CPCRI to being honored at eco-awareness events for our contribution to reducing plastic pollution.</p>
        <p>Each feature reflects our core mission: helping businesses transition away from single-use plastics through certified, biodegradable alternatives that meet CPCB compliance standards. Whether it's a news article, a social media spotlight, or an award recognition, this page keeps you informed about SAKRT's expanding impact in sustainable packaging.</p>
        <p>Follow our journey as we continue building partnerships with businesses ready to make the switch to eco-friendly solutions. Explore our latest media coverage below, and connect with us to learn how SAKRT's compostable products can support your sustainability&nbsp;goals.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400..700;1,400..700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');

  /* Container Setup */
  .media-hero-section {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 120px 3rem 5rem;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  /* --- Navbar Styles --- */
  .navbar {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1240px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 0.75rem 0;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  .logo a {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #0a2319;
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .nav-links a {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #4a5550;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
    padding-bottom: 4px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .nav-links a:hover {
    color: #0a2319;
  }

  /* Lime Underline for Active Menu item ("Journal") */
  .nav-links a.active {
    color: #0a2319;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .nav-links a.active::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -2px;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 3px;
    background-color: #c5ff49; /* SAKRT Lime Accent */
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .btn-inquire {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    background-color: #0a2319;
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.6rem;
    border-radius: 2rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-inquire:hover {
    background-color: #12382a;
  }

  /* --- Hero Body Styles --- */
  .hero-container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1240px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .hero-content {
    max-width: 1000px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  /* Tag Line */
  .tag-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .category-tag {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: #55625c;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .tag-line {
    width: 32px;
    height: 1px;
    background-color: #b0bab4;
  }

  /* Headline Header */
  .hero-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 2.98rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.12;
    color: #0a2319;
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Paragraph Text */
  .hero-description {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #4a5550;
    max-width: 100%;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 3rem 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }
  
  .hero-description p {
    margin: 0;
  }
  
  .hero-description a {
    color: #3b8c66;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: rgba(59, 140, 102, 0.4);
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
    transition: text-decoration-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .hero-description a:hover {
    text-decoration-color: rgba(59, 140, 102, 1);
  }

  /* Buttons Wrapper */
  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .btn {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.75rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    transition: all 0.25s ease;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  /* Solid Lime Button */
  .btn-lime {
    background-color: #c5ff49;
    color: #0a2319;
    border: 1px solid #c5ff49;
  }

  .btn-lime:hover {
    background-color: #b5f038;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(197, 255, 73, 0.3);
  }

  .arrow {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  /* Outline Button */
  .btn-outline {
    background-color: transparent;
    color: #0a2319;
    border: 1px solid rgba(10, 35, 25, 0.25);
  }

  .btn-outline:hover {
    background-color: rgba(10, 35, 25, 0.04);
    border-color: #0a2319;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  /* Responsive Queries */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .media-hero-section {
      padding: 120px 1.5rem 3rem;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: none; /* Add mobile menu drawer here if required */
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .hero-title {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      flex-direction: column;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .btn {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>